  "name": {
    "zh": "冬夜的蜡烛",
    "en": "Candles for Winter"
  },
  "story": {
    "zh": "冬夜漫长，家家户户都要点蜡烛。炼脂坊熬羊油，纺线厂用棉花做烛芯，两路原料一起送进制烛坊。熬油的味道太冲，炼脂坊旁边不能有民房。",
    "en": "Winter nights are long and every home needs candles. The tallow works renders mutton fat, the wick mill spins cotton wicks, and both lines feed the chandlery. The smell is so strong that no house may sit next to the tallow works."
  },
